# Test Reports

## Location

**`docs/sdd/test-reports/<feature-slug>.md`** (same slug as SDD).

## Required Sections

1. Scope
2. Review Summary
3. Edge Cases
4. Added / Updated Tests
5. Executed Test Cases (table: Test file, Scenario, Result, Notes)
6. Scenario Coverage
7. Command Evidence (table: Command, Exit code, Result, Output summary)
8. Coverage Evidence
9. Failures and Root Cause (omit if all passed)
10. Recommendations
11. Residual Risk

## Evidence

Never mark pass without command output in section 7.

## Ownership

`test-runner` owns reports. `doc-sync` links from SDD only.
